"test":{"name":"script-one-scene","kind":"rules","opponent":"Human","rounds":"4","check":"scriptOneScene","question":"One scene at a time (ScenarioScript): two triggers fire together, the first with two lines and an action between them, the second with one line: the second's line waits until the first's scene is over (A1, A2, then B1, never B1 between them); the second's action before its line goes ahead at once. Unit Damaged with Lost At Least 2: a 1-strength scratch does not count, a 2-strength hit does.","rules":"standard"},
